ecorder to record interviews, lectures, meetings and important conversations so you can listen later.\r\nYou can stream sound from your phone to your headphones or earbuds.\r\nUse Super Hearing from Distance with Bluetooth earphones for remote hearing, where you hear people from far away or hear from a distance. \r\nWhether you want to responsibly hear your environment, hear the TV and conversations better (non-medical hearing aid), or just listen to birdsong from indoors, Super Hearing from Distance amplifies and streams the audio from the mic to your Bluetooth headset (mic-to-headphone) for remote super hearing.\r\nHearing aid for your hearing problems and hearing clear from distance.\r\nUse your headphones or earbuds as hearing aids to amplify conversations and surrounding sounds or boost your hearing.\r\n\r\nYou can connect your Bluetooth-enabled hearing aids. \r\n\r\nUse your phone or Bluetooth earpiece's microphones to amplify surrounding sounds. You can listen to music whilst amplifying surrounding sounds and reducing noise.\r\n\r\nSuper Hearing Sound Magnifier amplifies the sounds around you and plays back over headphones and earbuds.\r\n\r\nYou can hear people from far away or from outside much clearer and louder.\r\nIf you\u2019re using Bluetooth earbuds, you can place your phone near a sound source.\r\n\r\nWorks with earphones, wired headphones, Bluetooth headphones, earbuds, Bluetooth headsets, hearing aids, USB headphones, AUX speakers, and Bluetooth speakers.\r\n\r\nListen to what\u2019s going on in your surroundings to avoid danger.\r\n\r\nRuns in the background so you can listen to music or do something else and still be able to hear and be more aware of your surroundings. \r\nSuper Hearing from Distance app comes with an Equalizer so you can control how you listen, amplifying speech and hear very low whispers.\r\n\r\nFor audio sources that are farther away, Bluetooth earphones are recommended.",
